# TriTown Fire Monitor — crontab
# pi_sender.py is NOT started here. It runs as a systemd service:
#   sudo systemctl status pi-sender
#   journalctl -u pi-sender -n 50

# Keep Render awake — ping dashboard every 3 minutes
*/3 * * * * curl -s https://tritown-monitor.onrender.com/api/stats > /dev/null

# WiFi watchdog — reconnect every 5 minutes, reboot if it fails
*/5 * * * * /home/pi/wifi_watchdog.sh
